   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Empty**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Swan Song**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Welcome to an Altered Future**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-08-16.mk21.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 177 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.THOR**: source not stated; 26 songs; 177 min [2]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.Birds**: source not stated; 26 songs; 176 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorded at Meadow Creek in Buena Vista, Colorado [1]\n- Fan Callum played Stu's guitar during the song [2]\n- Dimathaya Burarrwanga and Yimila Gurruwiwi performed on yiḏaki [2]\n- Positioned stage left, edge of SBD, extended up approximately eight feet [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-08-16.mk21.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk21 (ORTF wide) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [1]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.THOR**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor > PMD661 > 24/96 wav [2]. Also: ADK Thor ORTF pair, 12 feet left of SBD, 150 feet from stage [2]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.Birds**: taped by Birds; transferred by Birds; source: x2 Rode NT5 to H6 Handy Recorder [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2025-08-16 Meadow Creek, Buena Vista, CO, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-august-16-2025-meadow-creek-buena-vista-co-usa.html) [5]",
